ink for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.5 kg (1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-d1ac9479aeb1483eEND_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-aeaec3a2a08d1e98END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_MOO_NecromancerLab_DUBackgroundBook</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_MOO_NecromancerLab_DUBackgroundBook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_MOO_NecromancerLab_DUBackgroundBook\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">f19e7958-819d-473e-bed3-5aa5fb4101a3</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f19e7958-819d-473e-bed3-5aa5fb4101a3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f19e7958-819d-473e-bed3-5aa5fb4101a3\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers#Balthazar's_room\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Balthazar's Chambers</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Moonrise_Towers\" title=\"Moonrise Towers\">Moonrise Towers</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-126&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-179</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[This is a log on the work of one of <a href=\"/wiki/Balthazar\" title=\"Balthazar\">Balthazar's</a> necromancers, <a href=\"/wiki/Kressa_Bonedaughter\" title=\"Kressa Bonedaughter\">Kressa Bonedaughter</a>, dated two tendays ago.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>After the state the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dark_Urge\" title=\"The Dark Urge\">fallen one</a> was in, I never expected Kressa would be able to save it. I was hoping the usurped thing would die; that's what it would have wanted. It's not as if Kressa studying it is going to prove much - it was damaged in the attack far beyond what the mere tadpole could do. But she seems fond of the foul creature. Let her play with it.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>[Another entry seems to be written into this log, dated a tenday later.]\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>I should not have, in hindsight, let Kressa keep her pet. Ever since it was shipped onto one of the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">nautiloids</a> to be deployed, she has been inconsolable. 'It won't survive out there. It needs me. It isn't like the others.' The feral thing will make a fine warrior for the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>, and now my best assistant is distracted thinking about it.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Pah. She will come to heel again soon enough.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201704\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.052 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1657/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32744/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10332/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930390/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.188      1 -total\n 97.48%   42.099      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 54.60%   23.579      7 Template:Icon_text\n 48.32%   20.870     17 Template:Trim\n 22.50%    9.717      2 Template:Uid\n 15.05%    6.498      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.82%    5.538      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.49%    5.396      2 Template:Icon_link\n 10.17%    4.394      1 Template:Ifexist\n  9.56%    4.129      1 Template:Books\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:12740-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201704 and revision id 321921. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}